  "review": {
    "book": "JOS",
    "entityID": "place:judah_1280",
    "primaryWitnesses": [
      {
        "ref": "JOS 11:21",
        "textualBasisJa": "Joshua came at that time, and cut off the Anakim from the hill country, from Hebron, from Debir, from Anab, and from all the hill country of Judah, and from all the hill country of Israel. Joshua utterly destroyed them with their cities."
      },
      {
        "ref": "JOS 15:1",
        "textualBasisJa": "The lot for the tribe of the children of Judah according to their families was to the border of Edom, even to the wilderness of Zin southward, at the uttermost part of the south."
      },
      {
        "ref": "JOS 15:3",
        "textualBasisJa": "and it went out southward of the ascent of Akrabbim, and passed along to Zin, and went up by the south of Kadesh Barnea, and passed along by Hezron, went up to Addar, and turned toward Karka;"
      },
      {
        "ref": "JOS 15:7",
        "textualBasisJa": "The border went up to Debir from the valley of Achor, and so northward, looking toward Gilgal, that faces the ascent of Adummim, which is on the south side of the river. The border passed along to the waters of En Shemesh, and ended at En Rogel."
      },
      {
        "ref": "JOS 15:9",
        "textualBasisJa": "The border extended from the top of the mountain to the spring of the waters of Nephtoah, and went out to the cities of Mount Ephron; and the border extended to Baalah (also called Kiriath Jearim);"
      },
      {
        "ref": "JOS 15:12",
        "textualBasisJa": "The west border was to the shore of the great sea. This is the border of the children of Judah according to their families."
      },
      {
        "ref": "JOS 15:21",
        "textualBasisJa": "The farthest cities of the tribe of the children of Judah toward the border of Edom in the South were Kabzeel, Eder, Jagur,"
      },
      {
        "ref": "JOS 15:28",
        "textualBasisJa": "Hazar Shual, Beersheba, Biziothiah,"
      },
      {
        "ref": "JOS 15:39",
        "textualBasisJa": "Lachish, Bozkath, Eglon,"
      },
      {
        "ref": "JOS 15:42",
        "textualBasisJa": "Libnah, Ether, Ashan,"
      },
      {
        "ref": "JOS 15:43",
        "textualBasisJa": "Iphtah, Ashnah, Nezib,"
      },
      {
        "ref": "JOS 15:48",
        "textualBasisJa": "In the hill country, Shamir, Jattir, Socoh,"
      },
      {
        "ref": "JOS 15:53",
        "textualBasisJa": "Janim, Beth Tappuah, Aphekah,"
      },
      {
        "ref": "JOS 15:55",
        "textualBasisJa": "Maon, Carmel, Ziph, Jutah,"
      },
      {
        "ref": "JOS 15:56",
        "textualBasisJa": "Jezreel, Jokdeam, Zanoah,"
      },
      {
        "ref": "JOS 15:58",
        "textualBasisJa": "Halhul, Beth Zur, Gedor,"
      },
      {
        "ref": "JOS 20:7",
        "textualBasisJa": "They set apart Kedesh in Galilee in the hill country of Naphtali, Shechem in the hill country of Ephraim, and Kiriath Arba (also called Hebron) in the hill country of Judah."
      },
      {
        "ref": "JOS 21:11",
        "textualBasisJa": "They gave them Kiriath Arba, named after the father of Anak (also called Hebron), in the hill country of Judah, with its pasture lands around it."
      }
    ],
